                                                </Key>
                                                <Value>
                                                  <Single Type="string"> This FB is derived from VisuFbAnalyzeSingleColorVar. 
 It gets a single color, no AlarmColor. And an additonal bool value.
 as for one child, we dont allow expressions, we have to add this attribute here as well.
 Because this attribute is checked recursively
 The other member do work ok, as they have the animation attribute and therefore no recursive check is done.</Single>
